WEBVTT

00:00.470 --> 00:05.480
<b>Ten Years Ago</b>

00:05.980 --> 00:08.440
Wh-What is this?

00:08.440 --> 00:10.200
Where am I?

00:10.200 --> 00:12.240
Yes! A success!

00:13.670 --> 00:15.660
The summoning is a success!

00:15.660 --> 00:16.570
Heroes!

00:16.960 --> 00:21.360
God has sent us heroes to save Distinia!

00:21.360 --> 00:22.190
What?!

00:22.640 --> 00:26.390
You are visitors to our 
realm from another world.

00:27.120 --> 00:30.320
The god-sent saviors of our nation!

00:32.240 --> 00:41.810
Heroes! Heroes! Heroes!

00:34.160 --> 00:35.760
Wh-What?

00:35.760 --> 00:38.350
What are you idiots raving about?!

00:38.840 --> 00:40.720
I never agreed to that!

00:41.080 --> 00:41.810
Huh?

00:43.190 --> 00:48.610
Heroes or not, we just got dropped 
here with no idea what's going on!

00:48.610 --> 00:51.940
Don't try to dump your own problems on us!

00:55.950 --> 00:58.490
Hero, what is your name?

00:59.280 --> 01:02.240
Setsu. My name is Setsu.

01:03.250 --> 01:04.460
Setsu-san...

02:38.300 --> 02:43.010
<b><i>Episode 9</i></b>

02:38.300 --> 02:43.010
<b><i>Summoned to Another World for the First Time</i></b>

02:50.510 --> 02:53.930
Setsu-san, how can you stay so calm?

02:54.390 --> 02:57.820
After being dropped into this 
messed-up world out of the blue...

02:58.470 --> 03:02.770
This world has monsters and 
demon lords and stuff, right?

03:02.770 --> 03:06.790
If that's the case, we have to be strong,

03:06.790 --> 03:11.820
regardless of what we end up doing.

03:12.580 --> 03:15.130
I can't think like that.

03:15.650 --> 03:18.630
Going to war in this foreign world...

03:18.630 --> 03:21.130
I don't want to do that. I'm scared.

03:21.400 --> 03:25.970
Yeah, but complaining changes nothing,
 since we're already here.

03:25.970 --> 03:27.730
But it's a war!

03:28.230 --> 03:33.150
Having to risk our lives fighting enemies
we don't even know in this unknown land...

03:33.150 --> 03:35.070
That's just wrong.

03:35.560 --> 03:41.820
I know, but that doesn't justify 
us doing nothing right now.

03:42.690 --> 03:44.200
Yeah, but...

03:49.370 --> 03:53.950
Since we're in the same boat here, 
let's do our best to survive.

03:54.590 --> 03:57.500
As long as we stay alive,
I'm sure things will work out.

03:58.510 --> 03:59.680
Setsu-san...

04:06.480 --> 04:07.760
Hey, Toma.

04:07.760 --> 04:08.400
Huh?

04:09.220 --> 04:12.850
Let's stop this war. The two of us.

04:13.630 --> 04:14.900
Stop the war?

04:14.900 --> 04:16.690
You're right.

04:17.730 --> 04:22.440
Killing and getting killed by strangers 
in this unknown land is wrong.

04:23.900 --> 04:24.910
That's impossible.

04:25.470 --> 04:28.880
There's nothing we can do 
to stop an ongoing war.

04:28.880 --> 04:31.980
Besides, I'm not strong like you, Setsu-san.

04:38.670 --> 04:41.860
We're the chosen heroes, right?

04:41.860 --> 04:44.680
How do you know what's 
possible before we try?

04:45.760 --> 04:49.900
We're the only allies we've got,
since we come from the same place.

04:49.900 --> 04:52.330
In a way, we're brothers 
from the same hometown.

04:52.330 --> 04:55.090
So I'll protect you.

04:59.840 --> 05:01.100
Setsu-san...

05:02.500 --> 05:05.450
You can stop calling me "-san."

05:06.370 --> 05:08.440
That's a promise, Setsu.

05:08.950 --> 05:11.200
Yeah, it's a promise.

05:19.960 --> 05:22.540
Are you really leaving, Setsu?

05:22.540 --> 05:25.520
Yeah, I've gotten pretty strong.

05:25.520 --> 05:27.470
If I want to stop the war,

05:27.470 --> 05:30.220
I need to see this world with my own eyes.

05:31.540 --> 05:34.430
Sorry... I'm still scared.

05:40.160 --> 05:40.730
But...

05:42.860 --> 05:45.780
But I'll get stronger.

05:46.520 --> 05:49.180
Strong enough to fight and stop the war.

05:49.870 --> 05:52.020
So, when the time comes...

05:57.210 --> 06:01.500
Yeah, let's meet again once we've 
both become heroes for real.

06:02.160 --> 06:03.340
That's a promise.

06:24.560 --> 06:26.930
That's a promise, Setsu.

06:37.080 --> 06:38.970
Toma the Hero!

06:38.970 --> 06:41.620
Your valor and accomplishments in battle,

06:41.620 --> 06:45.440
your unflinching loyalty to the 
nation, and your endless effort

06:45.440 --> 06:51.720
have earned you the title of knight
and the honorific "Silver Hero"!

06:51.720 --> 06:56.120
I accept this overwhelming 
honor with gratitude.

07:00.030 --> 07:01.940
You finally did it, Toma-sama!

07:01.940 --> 07:03.660
A knight! You're finally a knight!

07:03.660 --> 07:06.420
Soon, you will be an officer... no, a general,

07:06.420 --> 07:08.990
and be able to lead this whole nation!

07:09.470 --> 07:12.270
It's way too early for that, guys.

07:13.200 --> 07:17.960
Setsu, I've gotten one step 
closer to our promise.

07:19.030 --> 07:21.360
I'll get stronger, 
both personally and politically.

07:21.360 --> 07:25.420
Then I can end this war.

07:27.320 --> 07:29.720
Of course, Toma-sama.

07:32.180 --> 07:34.210
I'll forge on to fulfill my dream.

07:34.880 --> 07:37.280
Are you all willing to die for me?

07:37.280 --> 07:38.440
Of course!

07:38.440 --> 07:40.850
Our lives for Toma-sama!

07:41.730 --> 07:43.240
Let's go, everyone!

07:43.240 --> 07:45.080
To my ideal world!

07:45.080 --> 07:47.730
Yes, sir!

07:56.770 --> 07:57.950
Heave, ho!

07:58.670 --> 08:00.230
Heave, ho!

08:02.500 --> 08:04.240
Heave, ho!

08:05.710 --> 08:07.340
Charge!

08:09.340 --> 08:11.310
Don't let anyone escape!

08:11.310 --> 08:14.450
If you let one escape, 
we'll be the next ones to die!

08:20.680 --> 08:21.550
No!

08:21.550 --> 08:23.310
It's the Silver Devil!

08:35.460 --> 08:36.700
What's this place?

08:46.470 --> 08:48.780
W-We surrender!

08:48.780 --> 08:50.250
Please, spare our lives—

08:50.250 --> 08:52.970
No. This war needs to end.

08:58.150 --> 09:01.180
Toma-sama, the temple has been cleared out.

09:03.240 --> 09:04.690
Good work.

09:05.290 --> 09:08.950
Reorganize the survivors. 
We'll head out immediately.

09:08.950 --> 09:09.750
Yes, sir.

09:22.680 --> 09:30.110
The weak, the pitiful,
the ones who should not exist.

09:31.300 --> 09:32.140
Who's there?

09:36.090 --> 09:39.150
I can see inside your heart.

09:40.060 --> 09:45.570
Your envy, your despair, your hatred.

09:45.570 --> 09:48.060
Yeah, whatever.

09:48.060 --> 09:51.900
I see your deepest secret, your true desire.

09:52.980 --> 09:54.720
My true desire?

09:58.850 --> 10:00.820
Who are you to tell me what my desires are?

10:00.820 --> 10:03.410
I will grant them to you.

10:03.410 --> 10:06.500
I will give you the power and the destiny.

10:13.440 --> 10:16.100
My desire is...

10:26.090 --> 10:31.900
Now, grasp me in your hand... 
To fulfill your desire.

10:32.350 --> 10:33.290
Come...

11:02.710 --> 11:05.020
Of course, Toma-sama.

11:06.110 --> 11:08.390
I'll forge on to fulfill my dream.

11:08.390 --> 11:10.850
Are you all willing to die for me?

11:10.850 --> 11:11.990
Of course!

11:11.990 --> 11:14.270
Our lives for Toma-sama!

11:18.560 --> 11:20.180
More enemies...

11:20.760 --> 11:22.480
I have to keep fighting...

11:22.970 --> 11:24.480
My promise...

11:24.480 --> 11:25.490
My dream...

11:30.530 --> 11:32.260
Toma-sama!

11:37.380 --> 11:39.750
An urgent message from the royal capital!

11:39.750 --> 11:41.450
A truce has been called in the name of peace.

11:41.450 --> 11:44.340
All forces are to immediately
cease hostilities!

11:45.420 --> 11:46.540
Peace?

11:47.480 --> 11:49.760
The delegation of leaders 
who will sign the treaty

11:49.760 --> 11:51.730
will be passing through this area soon.

11:51.730 --> 11:54.600
We are ordered to protect their safety.

12:01.360 --> 12:03.450
This magic power...

12:03.920 --> 12:05.130
Can you really?

12:05.130 --> 12:06.320
It's really good!

12:06.320 --> 12:08.840
You can say that, but...

12:08.840 --> 12:10.370
You don't trust me?

12:10.370 --> 12:12.400
Not until we taste it.

12:12.400 --> 12:13.580
Who eats squid?

12:22.810 --> 12:25.410
<i>Why is Setsu there?</i>

12:45.980 --> 12:49.370
Next is the unveiling ceremony for the 
monument to memorialize this peace.

12:50.530 --> 12:52.920
Representing the end of this long war

12:52.920 --> 12:56.510
and our hope for everlasting 
peace... here it is!

13:01.420 --> 13:04.630
Setsu the Hero! Setsu the Hero!

13:05.000 --> 13:08.540
Setsu the Hero! Setsu the Hero!

13:09.140 --> 13:10.720
Cheers!

13:10.720 --> 13:12.450
It's a festival!

13:12.450 --> 13:13.920
Cheers to peace!

13:13.920 --> 13:16.390
The war is over!

13:21.990 --> 13:24.320
What's wrong? You look sulky.

13:25.240 --> 13:26.260
Setsu...

13:28.570 --> 13:32.880
You're amazing, Setsu. 
You really ended the war.

13:33.540 --> 13:36.700
I just went places and did as I pleased.

13:37.210 --> 13:39.320
I didn't do anything special.

13:39.320 --> 13:43.710
Really? I could never do the same.

13:44.070 --> 13:48.550
Come on. You're much more important now, too.

13:48.890 --> 13:50.020
That's awesome.

13:52.480 --> 13:54.110
Our promise...

13:54.860 --> 13:57.320
My promise with you... This was the only way...

13:57.320 --> 13:59.100
Setsu-sama!

13:59.430 --> 14:01.360
Please hurry up!

14:01.360 --> 14:04.820
We can't start this party 
without the main guest!

14:05.500 --> 14:07.860
Oh, sorry! Be right there!

14:08.640 --> 14:10.320
So yeah, gotta go.

14:10.320 --> 14:13.030
I'm glad you're well, Toma.

14:14.690 --> 14:16.080
S-Setsu!

14:17.950 --> 14:20.270
Um, uh...

14:20.880 --> 14:22.520
You know...

14:22.800 --> 14:27.550
I worked hard in this world, too,
and went places myself.

14:27.550 --> 14:31.360
And I was told at a temple that 
my wish could be granted.

14:31.930 --> 14:33.850
So I...

14:33.850 --> 14:35.770
My wish is...

14:37.300 --> 14:38.280
Setsu...

14:38.880 --> 14:43.870
Now that the war is over, why don't we 
go back to our original world together?

14:44.410 --> 14:49.900
I actually found a way to go back.

14:52.080 --> 14:55.330
Go back? Why?

14:55.580 --> 14:56.180
Huh?

14:57.380 --> 15:00.420
This stupid war is finally over.

15:00.980 --> 15:04.870
There's still so much more 
to see in this place.

15:04.870 --> 15:08.050
This is finally the start of our 
happy-go-lucky life in another world.

15:14.240 --> 15:15.500
<i>Why?</i>

15:16.010 --> 15:18.480
<i>Why would Setsu say that to me?</i>

15:18.480 --> 15:22.550
<i>Do you feel despair because 
your vow was not kept?</i>

15:22.550 --> 15:27.360
<i>Do you feel envy because he 
does not see things as you do?</i>

15:27.360 --> 15:31.130
Well, best of luck with your life back home.

15:31.740 --> 15:33.200
See ya, Toma.

15:34.020 --> 15:36.020
<i>No, Setsu!</i>

15:36.020 --> 15:39.910
<i>No... You can't leave me again...</i>

15:40.260 --> 15:43.160
<i>You promised me...</i>

15:43.830 --> 15:48.170
<i>It has to be me by your side!</i>

15:49.970 --> 15:53.610
<i>Do you feel despair toward this world?</i>

15:55.080 --> 15:57.390
Setsu, I get it now.

15:59.110 --> 16:01.560
I'll destroy everything that gets in the way.

16:02.190 --> 16:04.460
Humans, demons, Beastmen...

16:05.070 --> 16:07.150
I'll kill them all!

16:07.520 --> 16:10.920
Then you'll go back to the way you were, right?

16:10.920 --> 16:12.400
Hey... Toma?

16:13.030 --> 16:16.900
Yes! Setsu, you have to pay 
attention to me and only me!

16:17.410 --> 16:20.950
If someone else is going to take 
you from me, I might as well...

16:22.670 --> 16:23.500
Glutton!

16:26.980 --> 16:27.630
Toma?!

16:31.510 --> 16:33.040
Yes, excellent!

16:33.040 --> 16:34.800
That's my Setsu!

16:36.940 --> 16:38.970
Toma! Snap out of it!

16:39.410 --> 16:42.100
You're the one who should
 snap out of it, Setsu!

16:42.640 --> 16:43.730
Setsu-sama?

16:46.840 --> 16:48.560
Who are they?

16:48.560 --> 16:52.320
Oh, they must be the ones who tricked you.

16:52.320 --> 16:55.640
I don't understand a word you're saying!

16:55.640 --> 17:00.700
People who get in my way, people who 
seduce Setsu... are all unnecessary.

17:00.700 --> 17:05.580
This world doesn't need anyone 
other than Setsu and me!

17:12.540 --> 17:14.170
Toma!

17:14.170 --> 17:15.880
Setsu!

17:27.900 --> 17:28.640
Setsu-sama!

17:28.640 --> 17:29.620
Setsu!

17:51.610 --> 17:53.090
Ouch...

17:56.930 --> 18:03.960
Hey, none of my wishes came true.

18:10.700 --> 18:13.870
I'm so tired now.

18:15.630 --> 18:20.930
I guess I was alone to the very end.

18:34.850 --> 18:36.650
What is this?

18:40.780 --> 18:42.620
Hey, get walking!

18:50.260 --> 18:52.900
Starting today's experiments now.

19:09.120 --> 19:12.940
Magic power levels are rising. 
This is dangerous for us.

19:12.940 --> 19:14.540
Data collection is our first priority.

19:14.540 --> 19:15.550
Understood.

19:19.200 --> 19:23.180
As expected, magic organ transplants between 
sisters do not trigger a rejection reaction.

19:24.240 --> 19:26.680
Let's transplant the other one immediately.

19:26.680 --> 19:29.750
No! No more experiments!

19:29.750 --> 19:30.850
Someone help me!

19:31.290 --> 19:34.460
Let me out! Let me out of here!

19:34.890 --> 19:37.940
I will escape this place, I swear!

19:37.940 --> 19:41.070
I will, I will, I will...

19:41.440 --> 19:45.450
There is no place for us 
to live in this world.

19:45.450 --> 19:47.600
No... No!

19:47.600 --> 19:51.930
No more! No, no, no!

19:51.930 --> 19:56.590
If we're not allowed to live or die 
in this world, we might as well...

19:58.550 --> 20:02.030
Oh, so there were others like me after all.

20:03.040 --> 20:07.310
Sure, I'll save you.

20:11.850 --> 20:13.690
What?! What's going on?!

20:13.690 --> 20:16.480
We're being attacked from above!

20:16.480 --> 20:17.800
The building won't hold!

20:21.030 --> 20:22.360
It's collapsing?!

20:22.360 --> 20:26.030
Let us out! Open these doors, you shitbags!

20:26.330 --> 20:31.310
No! I can't take this!

20:45.310 --> 20:49.260
There. Now you're all free.

20:51.450 --> 20:52.920
Won't you join me?

20:53.520 --> 20:56.400
I want to destroy this world full of despair.

20:56.790 --> 20:58.520
Destroy...

20:58.980 --> 21:00.860
...this world?

21:03.740 --> 21:05.360
You should come, too.

21:05.360 --> 21:09.320
We are the same, rejected by this world.

21:21.800 --> 21:24.820
I'm glad you're well, Setsu.

21:25.340 --> 21:29.050
I'll finally win you over this time.

21:39.060 --> 21:40.570
Thanks for waiting, guys.

21:41.120 --> 21:43.570
My wounds have completely healed.

21:44.270 --> 21:46.070
So, are you ready?

21:46.710 --> 21:51.350
Let's become gods together, 
as this world reaches its end.

23:27.000 --> 23:32.010
<b><i>Next Time</i></b>

23:27.000 --> 23:32.010
<b><i>Arriving at a Battlefield for a Second Time</i></b>

23:27.990 --> 23:31.030
Next time: 
"Arriving at a Battlefield for a Second Time."
